162 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 89 0 R/E(UN Women was established in 2010 through the General Assembly\220s institutional consolidation of UN work on women\220s rights and gender equality. It supports intergovernmental processes, helps countries translate global commitments into policy, coordinates UN-system work on gender equality and provides technical and normative support. Its work is guided by instruments including CEDAW, the Beijing Declaration and Platform for Action, the 2030 Agenda and the UN Women Strategic Plan 2026\2052029.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

163 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 89 0 R/T(Introduction to the Committee)/E(Introduction to the Committee)/Pg 12 0 R/K[13]>>
