266 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 93 0 R/E(Why AI changes the policy problem)/Pg 16 0 R/K[22]>>
endobj

267 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 93 0 R/E(Artificial intelligence changes the scale and speed of digital abuse. Generative systems can produce convincing synthetic text, images, audio and video at very low cost, while automated accounts can amplify material across multiple platforms. This creates a governance problem in which the harm may spread faster than a victim can report it and may cross several jurisdictions before a remedy is available.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[23]>>
endobj

