285 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 94 0 R/E(AI also complicates evidence. A manipulated image may be false while still causing real reputational, professional or psychological harm. The policy challenge is therefore not simply to prohibit \215deepfakes,\216 but to balance prevention, detection, evidence preservation, rapid remedies, privacy, due process and freedom of expression. UN Women\220s current strategy places technology-facilitated violence within the wider continuum of violence against women and emphasizes norms, data, digital ecosystems, survivor-centred justice and women\220s agency. )/Pg 17 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

