531 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 104 0 R/T(Concrete near-term priorities for a resolution:)/E(Concrete near-term priorities for a resolution:)/Pg 27 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

532 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 723 0 R/E(Close the gender data gap first \204 resource national surveys and adopt the comparable, sex-disaggregated methodologies called for in the Global Digital Compact, so progress can actually be verified.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

533 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 724 0 R/E(Adapt existing national models rather than reinventing them \204 safety-by-design duties, mandatory transparency reporting, and rapid-response channels for image-based abuse, as already codified in the EU's Digital Services Act, the UK's and Australia's Online Safety Acts, and India's intermediary rules.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

534 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 725 0 R/E(Build in AI-specific safeguards now \204 content provenance/watermarking standards, independent risk audits of generative-AI systems, and rapid de-indexing procedures with due-process-compliant appeals.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

535 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 726 0 R/E(Treat financing as foundational, not a closing clause \204 specify who pays, through what mechanism \(UN trust funds, gender-responsive national budgeting, safeguarded public-private partnerships\), and how compliance is reviewed over time.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

536 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 727 0 R/E(Distribute responsibility realistically \204 states legislate and fund; platforms redesign products and report transparently; civil society monitors and delivers survivor services; UN Women convenes and provides technical guidance.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

537 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 728 0 R/E(Anchor every clause in the existing textual record \204 the 2025 CSW69 political declaration, the Beijing+30 Action Agenda, and the Global Digital Compact, so the resolution accelerates commitments already made rather than asking states to accept an untested new mandate.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

