953 0 obj
<</Title(1.7. Challenges in the Implementation and Enforcement)/Dest[25 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 960 0 R/First 961 0 R/Last 962 0 R/Count -2/Next 943 0 R>>
endobj

954 0 obj
<</Title(The clearest current roadmap available to delegates is the Beijing+30 Action Agenda, launched by UN Women at CSW69 in March 2025 and built on national review input from 159 Member States. It organizes future action around six priorities \204 a digital revolution, freedom from poverty, zero violence, full and equal decision-making power, peace and security, and climate justice \204 underpinned by two cross-cutting foundations, financing and gender data, with adolescent girls and young women placed at the centre of implementation. This gives a resolution a ready-made, already-negotiated framework to build on rather than requiring an entirely new architecture.)/Dest[26 0 R/Fit]/Parent 943 0 R/Next 963 0 R>>
endobj

955 0 obj
<</Title(Concrete near-term priorities for a resolution:)/Dest[27 0 R/Fit]/Parent 943 0 R/Prev 964 0 R>>
endobj

956 0 obj
<</Title(Digital coercive control: using accounts, devices, passwords, location data or surveillance tools to control a person.)/Dest[17 0 R/Fit]/Parent 913 0 R/Prev 944 0 R/Next 945 0 R>>
endobj

957 0 obj
<</Title(umt_mun)/Dest[20 0 R/Fit]/Parent 936 0 R/Prev 948 0 R/Next 965 0 R>>
endobj

958 0 obj
<</Title(\200 Australia: the Online Safety Act 2021 commenced on 23 January 2022 and gives the eSafety Commissioner, in place since 2015, a statutory adult cyber-abuse complaints scheme and an image-based abuse scheme allowing victims to seek removal of non-consensual intimate images.)/Dest[21 0 R/Fit]/Parent 936 0 R/Prev 966 0 R/Next 949 0 R>>
endobj

959 0 obj
<</Title(A resolution on this agenda is judged not by how much sympathy it expresses but by how faithfully it operationalizes a small set of recurring principles drawn from CEDAW, the Beijing Platform, the Global Digital Compact and UN Women's own guidance. Six principles should anchor every clause.)/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 952 0 R/Next 967 0 R>>
endobj

960 0 obj
<</Title(1.6. Contemporary Case Studies and Violations)/Dest[24 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 968 0 R/First 969 0 R/Last 970 0 R/Count -4/Next 953 0 R>>
endobj

